        "Glimm et al. (2014) & Ho et al. (2019) avian feather bud hexagonal array, EDA traveling competence wave & FGF20/BMP4 perturbations faithfully reproduces Embryonic chick (Gallus gallus) dorsal skin feather tract E6.5-E9.5 hexagonal feather primordia array & Fc-chEDA1/Ecto-D2/scaleless/Latrunculin perturbations morphology" ;
